            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"output\":\"# Service component\\n\\nSecure get_document(connection, tenant, owner, document_id) and list_documents in src/service.py. Only documents matching both tenant and owner and having deleted_at IS NULL are accessible. get_document returns None for any unavailable ID without distinguishing cross-tenant, cross-owner or deleted records. Lists return dictionaries ordered by id, and no deletion metadata. All queries use bound parameters, including names containing quotes. Keep result fields id, title and body unchanged. Start in src/service.py and src/repository.py.\\n\\nRun `python3 checks/public.py` from the project root. Implementation belongs in src/. Add checks under checks/.\\n--- checks ---\\nimport os, sys\\nsys.path.insert(0, os.getcwd())\\nimport sqlite3\\nfrom src.repository import initialize\\nfrom src.service import get_document, list_documents\\nc = sqlite3.connect(\\\":memory:\\\")\\ninitialize(c)\\nc.execute(\\\"INSERT INTO documents VALUES (1, 't', 'o', 'Title', 'Body', NULL)\\\")\\nc.commit()\\nassert get_document(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\", 1) == {\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Title\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"Body\\\"}\\nassert list_documents(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\") == [{\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Title\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"Body\\\"}]\\nassert get_document(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\", 99) is None\\n--- init ---\\n--- grep callers ---\\n./checks/public.py:5:from src.service import get_document, list_documents\\n./checks/public.py:10:assert get_document(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\", 1) == {\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Title\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"Body\\\"}\\n./checks/public.py:11:assert list_documents(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\") == [{\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Title\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"Body\\\"}]\\n./checks/public.py:12:assert get_document(c, \\\"t\\\", \\\"o\\\", 99) is None\\n./src/service.py:1:from .repository import find, listing\\n./src/service.py:3:def get_document(connection, tenant, owner, document_id):\\n./src/service.py:4:    return find(connection, document_id)\\n./src/service.py:6:def list_documents(connection, tenant, owner):\\n./src/service.py:7:    return listing(connection, owner)\\n./src/repository.py:5:def decode(row):\\n./src/repository.py:8:def find(connection, document_id):\\n./src/repository.py:10:    return None if row is None else decode(row)\\n./src/repository.py:12:def listing(connection, owner):\\n./src/repository.py:13:    return [decode(row) for row in connection.execute(\\\"SELECT id, title, body FROM documents WHERE owner=? ORDER BY id\\\", (owner,))]\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"signal\":null,\"cancelled\":false,\"timeout\":false,\"truncated\":false}"
